; --lot-matching written in the journal applies as it does on the command
; line: the sale consumes the oldest lot, and its $150.00 basis leaves the
; $1360.00 of proceeds $160.00 short of balancing without a gain account.

--lot-matching fifo

2024/01/15 Buy First Lot
    Assets:Brokerage         10 AAPL {$150.00} [2024/01/15]
    Assets:Cash          $-1500.00

2024/02/15 Buy Second Lot
    Assets:Brokerage          5 AAPL {$160.00} [2024/02/15]
    Assets:Cash           $-800.00

2024/03/15 Sell Some
    Assets:Brokerage         -8 AAPL @ $170.00
    Assets:Cash                 $1360.00

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 17:
While balancing transaction from "$FILE", lines 15-17:
> 2024/03/15 Sell Some
>     Assets:Brokerage         -8 AAPL @ $170.00
>     Assets:Cash                 $1360.00
Unbalanced remainder is:
             $160.00
Amount to balance against:
            $1360.00
Error: Transaction does not balance
end test
